    "round": 2,
    "role": "maker",
    "content": "The specification now includes automatic metadata retrieval:\n\n- Pasting a valid public link automatically fetches its page title and description.\n- Both fields remain editable before and after saving.\n- Retrieval shows progress and stops within 10 seconds.\n- Missing or inaccessible metadata falls back gracefully: the URL becomes the editable title, the description stays blank, and saving remains available.\n- Retrieved data never overwrites the user’s edits.\n- Changing the URL clears stale metadata and triggers a fresh attempt.\n\nThe scope and quality checklist were updated and revalidated successfully:\n\n- [Updated specification](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/spec.md)\n- [Quality checklist](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/checklists/requirements.md)\n\nIf you approve this revised specification, I’ll move to the implementation-plan gate next.",
