    "round": 3,
    "role": "maker",
    "content": "The implementation plan is ready for review on branch `001-manage-bookmarks`.\n\n- [Implementation plan](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/plan.md)\n- [Technical research](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/research.md)\n- [Data model](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/data-model.md)\n- [API contract](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/contracts/openapi.yaml)\n- [Validation guide](/work/specs/001-manage-bookmarks/quickstart.md)\n\nThe plan uses one Next.js/TypeScript application, SQLite persistence, and a protected server-side metadata fetcher. It includes explicit safeguards against private-network access, unsafe redirects, oversized responses, stale retrieval results, and overwriting user edits.\n\nThe Spec Kit planning workflow also required defining the API, data transactions, automated tests, accessibility checks, and end-to-end acceptance walkthrough before implementation.\n\nPlease approve the plan or request changes. After approval, I’ll generate the dependency-ordered task breakdown; no code has been implemented yet.",
